#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:5 ee9a4525ac7847998db7103162e428c1
msgid "MAVLink Basics"
msgstr "MAVLink 基础"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:7 13aadf68c36d44d4afff6ea41632ad80
msgid ""
"`MAVLink <https://mavlink.io/en/>`__ is a serial protocol most commonly used"
" to send data and commands between vehicles and ground stations"
msgstr "`MAVLink <https://mavlink.io/en/>`__ 是一种串行协议，最常用于在载具与地面站之间传输数据和命令"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:9 3cb49ba414da43deb49f7bfdaab1a253
msgid ""
"The protocol defines a large set of messages which can be found in "
"`common.xml <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html>`__ and "
"`ardupilot.xml <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/ardupilotmega.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"该协议定义了大量消息，见 `common.xml <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html>`__ 和 "
"`ardupilot.xml <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/ardupilotmega.html>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:10 fb66c21b7a484d5f91fe0549625ca57d
msgid ""
"MAVLink messages can be sent over almost any serial connection and does not "
"depend upon the underlying technology (wifi, 900mhz radio, etc)"
msgstr "MAVLink 消息可通过几乎任何串行连接发送，不依赖底层技术（WiFi、900MHz 电台等）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:11 0a43b4bcf0014d5880b884dc416a394e
msgid ""
"The messages are not guaranteed to be delivered which means ground stations "
"or companion computers must often check the state of the vehicle to "
"determine if a command has been executed"
msgstr "消息不保证送达，因此地面站或伴飞计算机通常需要检查飞行器状态以确认命令是否已执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:14 450213ca28b04cef864ae7d3c0ed6b21
msgid "Message Format"
msgstr "消息格式"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:20 2ce57819960d439fa56e68e00b9ab9fb
msgid ""
"Messages are no more than 263 bytes (Mavlink version1.0) or 280 bytes "
"(Mavlink version 2.0)."
msgstr "消息长度不超过 263 字节（MAVLink 1.0 版）或 280 字节（MAVLink 2.0 版）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:21 43c4169081c54285be83f720f956aa20
msgid ""
"The sender always fills in the ``System ID`` and ``Component ID`` fields so "
"that the receiver knows where the packet came from.  The ``System ID`` is a "
"unique ID for each vehicle or ground station.  Ground stations normally use "
"a high system id like \"255\" and vehicles default to use \"1\" (this can be"
" changed by setting the :ref:`MAV_SYSID <MAV_SYSID>` parameter).  The "
"``Component ID`` for the ground station or flight controller is normally "
"\"1\".  Other MAVLink capable device on the vehicle (i.e. companion "
"computer, gimbal) should use the same ``System ID`` as the flight controller"
" but use a different ``Component ID``"
msgstr ""
"发送方总是填写 ``System ID`` 和 ``Component ID`` 字段，让接收方知道数据包来自哪里。``System ID`` "
"是每台载具或地面站的唯一 ID。地面站通常用 \"255\" 这样的高位系统 ID，载具默认用 \"1\"（可通过 :ref:`MAV_SYSID "
"<MAV_SYSID>` 参数修改）。地面站或飞控的 ``Component ID`` 通常是 \"1\"。载具上其他具备 MAVLink "
"能力的设备（如协处理器、云台）应使用与飞控相同的 ``System ID``，但使用不同的 ``Component ID``"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:22 68ec6f34975e45439b2d73f9e32b2b9c
msgid ""
"The ``Message ID`` field can be seen in the `common.xml "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html>`__ and `ardupilot.xml "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/ardupilotmega.html>`__ next to the message "
"name.  For example the `HEARTBEAT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HEARTBEAT>`__ message Id is "
"\"0\""
msgstr ""
"``Message ID`` 字段可在 `common.xml "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html>`__ 和 `ardupilot.xml "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/ardupilotmega.html>`__ 中消息名旁边查到。例如 "
"`HEARTBEAT <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HEARTBEAT>`__ 消息的 Id "
"是 \"0\""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:23 55deec737df84827bbb254d03d9248d0
msgid ""
"The ``Data`` portion of the message holds the individual field values being "
"sent"
msgstr "消息的 ``Data`` 部分包含发送的各个字段值。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:24 cd8acdf18e174084b005776a3a8793df
msgid ""
"See this page for advice on how to :ref:`add support for a new MAVLink "
"message <code-overview-adding-a-new-mavlink-message>`"
msgstr ""
"关于如何 :ref:`为新的 MAVLink 消息添加支持 <code-overview-adding-a-new-mavlink-"
"message>`，请参考该页面的建议"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:27 af2ee8c36e15420c9a021bd21270ec27
msgid "High Level Message Flow"
msgstr "高层消息流程"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:33 dc2fd83122074e678ad30b01ba236492
msgid ""
"Once a connection is opened each device (aka \"System\") sends the "
"`HEARTBEAT <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HEARTBEAT>`__ message"
" at 1hz"
msgstr ""
"连接建立后，每台设备（即\"系统\"）以 1hz 发送 `HEARTBEAT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HEARTBEAT>`__ 消息"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:34 d9b70a6089ba4034b3d740166628ba0c
msgid ""
"The ground station or companion computer :ref:`requests the data <mavlink-"
"requesting-data>` it wants (and the rate) by sending messages of the "
"following types"
msgstr "地面站或协处理器通过发送以下类型的消息 :ref:`请求所需数据 <mavlink-requesting-data>` （及其速率）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:36 6c022cb3f436441f8c735868219274c1
msgid ""
"`REQUEST_DATA_STREAM "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#REQUEST_DATA_STREAM>`__ supports"
" setting the rate of groups of messages"
msgstr ""
"`REQUEST_DATA_STREAM "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#REQUEST_DATA_STREAM>`__ "
"支持按消息组设置速率"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:37 903d95d66ebc4f45afab0ea60fa1890a
msgid ""
"`COMMAND_LONG <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ "
"containing a `SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL>`__"
" command provides precise control of which messages are sent (and their "
"rate) but is only supported on ArduPilot 4.0 and higher"
msgstr ""
"包含 `SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL>`__"
" 命令的 `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ "
"可精确控制发送哪些消息（及其速率），但仅 ArduPilot 4.0 及更高版本支持"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:39 d26e6b5c6b774fe9be56cd69d8a6a697
msgid ""
"Ground station or companion computer send commands to the vehicle.  Details "
"of the supported commands are :ref:`here for copter <copter-commands-in-"
"guided-mode>` and :ref:`plane <plane-commands-in-guided-mode>`"
msgstr ""
"地面站或协处理器向载具发送命令。支持的命令详见 :ref:`Copter 命令 <copter-commands-in-guided-mode>` 和 "
":ref:`Plane 命令 <plane-commands-in-guided-mode>`"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:42 8b5cead40ad547489fc2dda7c71a54ea
msgid "MAVLink1 vs MAVLink2"
msgstr "MAVLink1 与 MAVLink2 对比"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:43 cbab66b961f841469d3e921895ed0292
msgid ""
"MAVLink2 messages have a maximum of 280 bytes of length, as they implement "
"compatibility flags and support for signature."
msgstr "MAVLink2 消息最大长度为 280 字节，因为它实现了兼容性标志和签名支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:44 7f5d231c07d64e7983e60ce2b88b2ebb
msgid ""
"MAVLink2 extends MAVLink1 by allowing new fields to be added to existing "
"MAVLink1 messages, supports new messages with ``Message ID`` over \"255\" "
"and adds support for signing messages"
msgstr ""
"MAVLink2 对 MAVLink1 进行了扩展，允许向现有 MAVLink1 消息中添加新字段，支持 ``Message ID`` "
"超过「255」的新消息，并增加了消息签名支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:45 5586645636854fd99e1dbe66d75639f9
msgid ""
"MAVLink2 is backwards compatible with MAVLink1 meaning that if a device "
"understands MAVlink2 messages it certainly understands MAVLink1 messages"
msgstr "MAVLink2 与 MAVLink1 向后兼容，这意味着能够理解 MAVLink2 消息的设备必然也能理解 MAVLink1 消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:46 bd22ba9a3edf45278beffdbf7d44d4c1
msgid ""
"If a device only capable of understanding MAVLink1 receives a message that "
"includes additional fields (added under MAVLink2) the device will only see "
"the original fields.  I.e. the device will be able to read the message but "
"will not \"see\" the additional fields"
msgstr ""
"如果只能理解 MAVLink1 的设备收到包含附加字段（在 MAVLink2 "
"下添加）的消息，该设备只能看到原始字段。即设备能够读取消息，但「看不到」附加字段。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:47 d8e631b013884a618df05f9fbfa8f0bf
msgid ""
"A flight controller's serial port (presumably connected to a telemetry "
"radio) can be set to use MAVLink2 by setting the ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` "
"parameter to \"2\" (where \"x\" is the serial port number on the flight "
"controller)"
msgstr ""
"可以通过将飞控串口的 ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` 参数设置为「2」来启用 "
"MAVLink2（其中「x」为飞控上的串口编号，该串口通常连接数传电台）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-basics.rst:48 2a5b4403fdd84f51becd8cfd477c7d4a
msgid ""
"See `Mavlink2 Documentation <https://mavlink.io/en/guide/mavlink_2.html>`__ "
"for more information (especially on message extensions)"
msgstr ""
"更多信息（尤其是消息扩展）见 `Mavlink2 文档 <https://mavlink.io/en/guide/mavlink_2.html>`__"
